<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Set object's maximum health.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Remarks">Remarks</span></h2>
<p>This function doesn't seem to work for creatures.
</p><p>It appears that Chargen_ModifyCreaturePropertyBase with PROPERTY_DEPLETABLE_HEALTH will increase or decrease maximum health by the specified amount. This workaround has not yet been tested exhaustively, but it is based on the Bioware code in sys_autoscale_h.
</p>
